    description: "Zenodo archive of BUARO, all versions"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uomoathens/buaro"
url: "https://uomoathens.github.io/buaro/"
abstract: "Open software that turns the Bayesian Urban Adaptation and Resilience Optimization Model of the book AI for Planetary Resilience into a self-updating instrument. It estimates heat-related mortality by area from official European data, tests itself on unseen summers, measures urban cooling from Landsat at 100 m, projects heat deaths at 1.5, 2 and 3 degrees of global warming, and ranks protective measures."
keywords:
  - heat-related mortality
  - climate adaptation
  - urban resilience
  - Bayesian modelling
  - Copernicus
  - Eurostat
  - Landsat
  - local digital twin
